DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261101T000000Z
SUMMARY:Leaves of Thanks
DESCRIPTION:\nThroughout November\, stop by any Leon County Public Library location or visit tinyurl.com/LeavesOfThanks to “leaf” a note sharing a book\, author\, or library service you’re thankful for.\n
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-19758-17695457
URL:https://leoncountyfl.libcal.com/event/17695457
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261101T000000Z
SUMMARY:Seek and Find at the Library
DESCRIPTION:Put your observation skills to the test with Seek and Find at the Library! Celebrate National Family Literacy Month with a self-directed challenge for youth and their families. Search for items\, explore together and earn special prizes throughout November at all Leon County Public Library locations.\n
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-19758-17695307
URL:https://leoncountyfl.libcal.com/event/17695307
END:VEVENT
